# Small synthetic sample used to validate the perf test harness itself (see
# ScraperPerfClassificationTest / ScraperPerfQueryCountTest). Deliberately NOT taken from any
# real user library - just representative filenames covering the buckets the perf tests report
# on: confident year "(YYYY)", non-confident year at start, non-confident year at end/middle,
# no year at all, and a TV show episode (skipped by the query-count test, counted by the
# classification test). For real measurements, point NOVA_PERF_VIDEO_LIST at a real, large
# filename list instead (see class docs).
Inception (2010) 1080p BluRay x264.mkv
The.Matrix.1999.1080p.BluRay.x264-GROUP.mkv
2001 A Space Odyssey.mkv
Class of 1999.mkv
Wonders of the Sea 3D (2017) MULTi VFI 2160p 10bit 4KLight HDR BluRay DD+5.1 x265-QTZ.mkv
Some Movie Without Any Year At All.mkv
